# Gate 0 across the Castle Frelia change (port/test/README.md, "Chapter
# saves"; make -f port/test/Makefile chapsave-frelia). Save: the last suspend
# save of Chapter 1 in the bot routes (Eirika's seize, route_ch1.keys tick
# 19,883), resumed:
#   make -f port/test/Makefile sram-capture SAVE_KEYS=port/test/inputs/route_ch1.keys \
#       SAVE_AT=suspend:1 SAVE_NAME=ch1_seize
# Ticks 0-1,999 are resume.keys (Resume Chapter). The seize then plays on:
# the end of Chapter 1, the world map scene and the Castle Frelia scenes
# (chapterIndex 56, the route's ticks 19,913-20,277), each skipped with Start
# while its text waits; the save menu (slot 0); the world map; and Chapter 2
# up to its first player phase. Every press comes in a state that waits for
# input (checked on the GBA frames, 2026-10-20): 7,600 ticks in all.
